            "href": "https://paulgraham.com/donate.html"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": " is a bit better, but even if the grant is explicitly unrestricted, you’ll likely feel honor-bound to do things that the grant-giver would approve of. ",
